e":"守居园池杂题 竹坞","author":"文同","text":"文石间苍苔，相引入深坞。\n莫撼青琅玕，无时露如雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6529,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"守居园池杂题 披锦亭","author":"文同","text":"繁红层若云，密绿叠如浪。\n青帝下寻春，满园开步障。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6530,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"守居园池杂题 荻浦","author":"文同","text":"枯荻饶霜风，暮寒声索索。\n无限有微禽，捉之宿如客。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6531,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"守居园池杂题 望云楼","author":"文同","text":"巴山楼之东，秦岭楼之北。\n楼上捲帘时，满楼云一色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6532,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"守居园池杂题 湖桥","author":"文同","text":"飞桥架横湖，偃若长虹卧。\n自问一日中，往来凡几过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6533,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"守居园池杂题 禊亭","author":"文同","text":"悬流效曲水，上巳娱嘉宾。\n饮罢已陈迹，那复山阴人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6534,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"守居园池杂题 筼筜谷","author":"文同","text":"千舆翠羽盖，万锜绿沈枪。\n定有葛陂种，不知何处藏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":